// pfodWeb NOTE: this board only exists in the real Arduino IDE as a
// "Revision" submenu option under a different parent board id (no
// standalone <id>.name= boards.txt entry of its own), so the normal
// boards.txt id lookup can't give it a unique name — without this
// override it would silently collide with every other board sharing
// this chip's default boardName. Full copy of variants/esp32/esp32/board.json with
// only boardName/displayName changed.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO25 tagged "led_high" - confirmed via official LilyGO vendor
// product page (lilygo.cc "LoRa32 V1.0 Kit"): "Blue light - IO25 programmable
// control". pins_arduino.h's LED_BUILTIN=2 alias is WRONG for this board (not a
// real LED) - see notes.txt for full research trail. No onboard user button was
// confirmed for this V1.0 revision (KEY_BUILTIN=0 alias not confirmed as a real
// user button either) - left untagged, see notes.txt.
